   "widgets_values": [
    "fp_16_fast enables \"Full FP16 Accmumulation in FP16 GEMMs\" feature available in the very latest pytorch nightly, this is around 20% speed boost. \n\nSageattn if you have it installed can be used for almost double inference speed"
